BEHAVIOR read_line

DESCRIPTION
  Reads a line from standard input (stdin).
  Reads until newline (0x0A) or max_length reached.
  Newline is included in output if present.
  Returns number of bytes read, 0 on EOF, negative on error.

CONTRACT
  INPUT max_length int 8
  OUTPUT buffer bytes 65536
  OUTPUT bytes_read int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 84aa1732

NATIVE
